==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 5 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Charcadet Drop Event]], which ran from March 11 to 21, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Smoliv|21}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards feature the '''Nutrients''' attack.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

